<speak>Yes, I am willing to accept an investment loss from selling. I would rather reduce my exposure and have the cash available. The amount I am instructing for this transaction is 10,000. Please set the transaction quantity at 100 units. On the paperwork, you are right about the different routes. Sometimes the receptionist puts a personal envelope on my desk, sometimes somebody leaves it with the office mail, and sometimes I have already downloaded a digital copy before the paper arrives. Then I wonder whether I have dealt with it or only looked at it. I do not think anyone is being careless. We just never agreed on one simple method, and the arrangement grew around whoever happened to be nearby. Now that more people are helping at the office, that old habit is showing its weaknesses.</speak>